# Runtime health-report outputs (root-anchored).
# A bare `reports/` matched every directory named `reports` at any depth and
# shadowed the tracked evidence plane `docs/reports/` (137 files): new files
# there were refused by plain `git add` and ignore-respecting traversals
# (rg/scan tooling) saw none of the tree. Anchor to the root so runtime
# outputs stay ignored while the evidence plane stays visible. (#3047 item 19)
/reports/

# Agent continuous loop runtime state
# (#3573: agent_cadence_state.json is orphaned by the event-driven regime —
# the rotation state now lives in agent_rotation_state.json; keep the old
# name ignored so stale timer-regime files can never resurface in git.)
scripts/agents/agent_cadence_state.json
scripts/agents/agent_rotation_state.json
scripts/agents/dispatched_issues_state.json

